{
    "info": {
        "name": "CredVault — Export Credentials API",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
        "description": "Export Credentials (Team Vault): My or Team, filtered as the table, every table column in the file.\n\nBEFORE YOU START\n1. Fill baseUrl, email/password (an employee with Credentials Vault → View), adminEmail/adminPassword (a client admin of the same company), managerEmail/managerPassword (that employee's reporting manager, in the same team). `password` is also the account password for the export with passwords.\n2. Run 00 · Setup (it saves myDepartmentId), then 01 · Export Credentials in order.\n\nFILE COLUMNS: Sr. No · Credential ID · Created On · Credential Name · Website / App · Type · Category · Username · Owner · Access · Department · Vault · Risk · Strength · 2FA · Rotation (days) · Last Updated · [Password / Secret] · [Notes].\nResponse headers: X-CredVault-Code (EX-…), X-CredVault-Count, X-CredVault-Withheld.\n\nFull details: docs/CREDVAULT_VAULTS_API_SHEET.md → Export Credentials."
    },
    "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
            {
                "key": "token",
                "value": "{{token}}",
                "type": "string"
            }
        ]
    },
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "00 · Setup",
            "description": "Log in three people: the requester ({{token}}), the Vault Admin ({{adminToken}}) and the requester's reporting manager ({{managerToken}}). Then read the types and the two vaults.",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Login — requester (employee)",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "noauth"
                        },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "login"
                            ]
                        },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "const b = pm.response.json();",
                                    "if (b.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', b.token);",
                                    "pm.test('token stored', () => pm.expect(pm.collectionVariables.get('token')).to.not.eql(''));",
                                    "if (b.needs_org_selection) console.warn('This email exists in several companies — pick the org in the app first, or use a unique login.');"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Login — Vault Admin (client admin)",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "noauth"
                        },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "login"
                            ]
                        },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "const b = pm.response.json();",
                                    "if (b.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', b.token);",
                                    "pm.test('token stored', () => pm.expect(pm.collectionVariables.get('adminToken')).to.not.eql(''));",
                                    "if (b.needs_org_selection) console.warn('This email exists in several companies — pick the org in the app first, or use a unique login.');"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Login — requester's reporting manager",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "noauth"
                        },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "login"
                            ]
                        },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{managerEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{managerPassword}}\"\n}"
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "const b = pm.response.json();",
                                    "if (b.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('managerToken', b.token);",
                                    "pm.test('token stored', () => pm.expect(pm.collectionVariables.get('managerToken')).to.not.eql(''));",
                                    "if (b.needs_org_selection) console.warn('This email exists in several companies — pick the org in the app first, or use a unique login.');"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Meta — 25 types, vaults, 2-step methods",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/meta",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "meta"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                                    "const b = pm.response.json();",
                                    "try { const v = b.data.me.department_id; if (v !== undefined && v !== null) pm.collectionVariables.set('myDepartmentId', String(v)); } catch (e) {}",
                                    "pm.test('25 types', () => pm.expect(b.data.types.length).to.eql(25));",
                                    "pm.test('two vaults', () => pm.expect(b.data.vaults.map(v => v.prefix)).to.eql(['CRD', 'CCRD']));"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "01 · Export Credentials",
            "description": "The Export Credentials popup.\n\n• GET /exports/preview — the popup before the download: total, selected (\"20 of 41\"), a count per category box, the My / Team tab counts.\n• POST /exports — the file: tab (mine | team, required), department_id, vault, risk, type, q, groups[] (the ticked categories), format csv | json, include_notes, include_passwords (+ acknowledge and account_password).\n• GET /exports — the history.\n\nThe first request adds a team credential as the employee; the Team exports run as their reporting manager (managerToken), who sees it under Team Credentials — the team credentials of the people below you in the reporting line.",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Add a team credential (yours — your manager sees it under Team Credentials)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/normal-vault/credentials",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "normal-vault",
                                "credentials"
                            ]
                        },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"type\": \"login\",\n    \"name\": \"GitHub Organisation (team) {{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"scope\": \"team\",\n    \"fields\": {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/inorbvict\",\n        \"username\": \"devops@inorbvict.com\",\n        \"password\": \"G1thub!Org-2026#Strong\"\n    }\n}",
                            "options": {
                                "raw": {
                                    "language": "json"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "description": "Team Credentials are the team credentials of the people below you in the reporting line (HOD → TL → Employee → Intern). The employee adds one here; their reporting manager (managerToken) exports the Team tab below."
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Add one of my credentials (for the My export)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/normal-vault/credentials",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "normal-vault",
                                "credentials"
                            ]
                        },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"type\": \"login\",\n    \"name\": \"Zoho Books Admin {{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"notes\": \"Accounts team\",\n    \"fields\": {\n        \"url\": \"https://books.zoho.in\",\n        \"username\": \"admin@inorbvict.com\",\n        \"password\": \"Zb!Admin-2026#Strong\"\n    }\n}",
                            "options": {
                                "raw": {
                                    "language": "json"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Export popup — counts, My Credentials",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/exports/preview?tab=mine",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "exports",
                                "preview"
                            ],
                            "query": [
                                {
                                    "key": "tab",
                                    "value": "mine"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                                    "const b = pm.response.json();",
                                    "pm.test('5 categories that add up', () => { pm.expect(b.data.groups.length).to.eql(5); pm.expect(b.data.groups.reduce((n, g) => n + g.count, 0)).to.eql(b.data.total); });"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Export popup — counts, Team Credentials (as the manager)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/exports/preview?tab=team&department_id={{myDepartmentId}}",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "exports",
                                "preview"
                            ],
                            "query": [
                                {
                                    "key": "tab",
                                    "value": "team"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "department_id",
                                    "value": "{{myDepartmentId}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "bearer",
                            "bearer": [
                                {
                                    "key": "token",
                                    "value": "{{managerToken}}",
                                    "type": "string"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                                    "const b = pm.response.json();",
                                    "pm.test('both tab counts', () => pm.expect(b.data.tabs).to.include.keys('mine', 'team'));"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
